                            <comment id="16780624" author="agoncharuk" created="Thu, 28 Feb 2019 15:25:30 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Suggested solution is to check the join count in the message worker thread, so that the race is never possible.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
